Spec: Independent .NET server lease verification

Purpose:
  Verify actual Go-issued standard tokens and bounded authorization lifetime without Agent storage or cloud services.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Authority.Tests.csproj
  ./Program.cs

Must:
  Run source-built issuer and JVM fixtures only as held Job children in protected artifact directories.
  Verify signatures, exact scope and signed malformed inputs; never print token contents.
  Exercise stalled UTC, monotonic rollback, replay, late higher sequences and permanently closed control generations.
  Keep interoperability proof distinct from installed runtime, FRP and physical device acceptance.
